<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 2.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 2.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	19.57     2.35</p>
<p> 2   Central Norseman    14.21     0.95</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld    13.33     5.25</p>
<p> 4   Pac Mutal Aust	12.45     2.41</p>
<p> 5   Kurts (P) Prop	10.49     1.43</p>
<p> 6   Multistack	    10.34     0.29</p>
<p> 7   Prime Credit Tr     10.32     0.95</p>
<p> 8   Prop Income Inv     10.31     0.99</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	 10.11     0.90</p>
<p>10   BT Prop Trust	 10.07     1.62</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual	9.80     1.08</p>
<p>12   Gem Property Tr	9.73     1.44</p>
<p>13   Villa World	    9.62     1.04</p>
<p>14   Burns, Philp &amp; Co    9.36     1.87</p>
<p>15   OLS Asia Hldgs	 9.36     0.78</p>
<p>16   Blackmores Lab	 9.28     3.45</p>
